After installation, you can run the Instant Replay 
Demo at anytime.  Just type IRDEMO from the DOS 
prompt or RUN IRDEMO from the Windows Program 
Manager.

We have included IRDEMO.PIF and IRDEMO.ICO files for
use with Windows.  If you want to add the demo as an
ICON selectable program item, copy these files to your
Windows directory.

You may copy and distribute this Demo as needed.
This Demo Disk is copy-requested.
